# Class: <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000003> (allodynia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.iasp-pain.org/resources/terminology") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000003> "Pain due to a stimulus that does not normally provoke pain.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000589> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000003> "allodynia (PAIN)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000003> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899>)
