AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000003> "The stimulus leads to an unexpectedly painful response. This is a clinical term that does not imply a mechanism. Allodynia may be seen after different types of somatosensory stimuli applied to many different tissues.
See entry in https://www.iasp-pain.org/resources/terminology.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000003> "allodynia")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000003> "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012533")
